1
00:00:02,627 --> 00:00:05,877
(Sheldon:)Fellow warriors,
this is Sheldor the Conqueror.

2
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,877
We are about to enter Atzel's fortress.

3
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:11,889
(Sheldon:)Now, this is a long run,
so let's do another bladder check.

4
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:17,972
All right, Barry, we'll wait for you again,
but you really should see a doctor.

5
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:20,729
[BANGING NEARBY]

6
00:00:22,105 --> 00:00:24,895
(Sheldon:)Sheldor is AFK.

7
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:31,615
(Sheldon:)Penny, are you experiencing
some sort of difficulty?

8
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:34,281
(Penny:)Yes, I can't get my stupid door open.

9
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:38,621
(Sheldon:)You appear to have put your car key
in the door lock. Are you aware of that?

10
00:00:39,247 --> 00:00:40,787
(Penny:)Yeah.

11
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:43,039
All right, then.

12
00:00:44,502 --> 00:00:47,422
PENNY:
Damn it, damn it, damn it.

13
00:00:47,589 --> 00:00:50,629
(Sheldon:)Would it be possible for you
to do this a little more quietly?

14
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:54,557
- I can't get the damn key out.
- That's not surprising.

15
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:58,101
(Sheldon:)That Baldwin lock on your door uses
traditional edge-mounted cylinders...

16
00:00:58,266 --> 00:01:04,026
...whereas the key for your Volkswagen
uses a center-cylinder system.

